Third-party components included in this repository:

- cli/third_party/midifile — Craig Sapp's midifile library
  (http://midifile.sapp.org), copied from the Denjhang Music Player project.
  Distributed under its original license, see that directory.
- docs/_vendor/ym-voice-0.3.2 — ym-voice (ISC license), vendored as a
  reference for the OPM/OPN/OPL/OPLL voice conversion port.

